Type "bash .agents/tests/zs-smart-sessionizer/demo-run.sh ours inside"
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "alpha"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 700ms
Type "default"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 500ms
